The file data/orthographies.json is generated from the Hyperglot Python package
(see scripts/export-data.py) and contains, per orthography, the Unicode codepoints
a font must support. It is a derived dataset distributed under the same Apache-2.0
license as Hyperglot. A copy of the Apache-2.0 license is available at:

